## 7. Component Showcase

Create:

```
app/styleguide/components/[component-name]/page.tsx
```

The Styleguide is the official visual approval environment.

Every showcase must contain:

### Variants

All supported variants.

### Sizes

All supported sizes.

### States

- default
- hover
- focus
- active
- selected
- disabled
- loading
- empty
- success
- warning
- error

### Light / Dark

Both themes.

### Real Examples

Examples based on real CRM scenarios.

### Composition

How the component integrates with other components.

### Responsive

Desktop
Tablet
Mobile

### Code Examples

Basic
Advanced
Composition

